 stroke="#273a4d" stroke-opacity="0.42" stroke-width="2"></rect></g><path fill="url(#_R_2mhr_-light)" d="M0 0h1400v1200H0z"></path><text x="54" y="1137" fill="#f3f6f7" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="21" letter-spacing="1">KIKORA / STUDIO</text><text x="1145" y="1137" fill="#f3f6f7" font-family="monospace" font-size="14">FORM STUDY — 001</text></svg><span class="k_5993a0c_reflection" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="k_5993a0c_padBack" role="img" aria-label="玻璃鼠标垫背面的深灰色底垫结构示意" aria-hidden="true"><span class="k_5993a0c_baseMat"></span></div></div><div class="k_5993a0c_surfaceLabel" aria-hidden="true"><span></span>ARTIST — 001</div></div><div class="k_5993a0c_stageBottom"><p>拖动查看形态 · 方向键也可以调整</p><span aria-hidden="true">↔</span></div><p id="_R_3_-instructions" class="k_5993a0c_srOnly">左右方向键旋转，上下方向键调整倾斜；Home 键复位。</p><div class="k_5993a0c_faceControls"><div role="group" aria-label="选择正面或底部"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">图案正面</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">背面 · 底胶</button></div><p id="_R_3_-base-note">底部为结构示意，定制底胶的纹路、材质与最终结构尚未确定。</p></div></section><div class="k_5993a0c_controls"><div class="k_5993a0c_presets" role="group" aria-label="选择观察视角"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true"><span>0<!-- -->1</span>整体</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span>0<!-- -->2</span>表面</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span>0<!-- -->3</span>边缘</button></div><div class="k_5993a0c_sliders"><label for="_R_3_-tilt"><span>倾斜角度<output>46<!-- -->°</output></span><input id="_R_3_-tilt" type="range" min="10" max="76" value="46"/></label><label for="_R_3_-turn"><span>左右旋转<output>-12<!-- -->°</output></span><input id="_R_3_-turn" type="range" min="-35" max="35" value="-12"/></label><button type="button" class="k_5993a0c_reset">复位视角<!-- --> ↺</button></div></div><div class="k_5993a0c_galleryColumn"><div class="k_5993a0c_exhibitCaption"><div><span>KIKORA / 原创抽象研究</span><h2>另一种空间。</h2><p>蓝灰、光线，与层叠的几何形态。</p></div><span class="k_5993a0c_swatches" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><p class="k_5993a0c_conceptNote">当前为原创视觉研究，具体画师合作与最终款式尚未公布。</p></div><section class="k_5993a0c_gallery" aria-label="Artist 概念展厅"><div class="k_5993a0c_story"><div class="k_5993a0c_storyIntro"><span>向下走进创作</span><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></div><article class="k_5993a0c_chapter"><span class="k_5993a0c_chapterNumber">01</span><p class="k_5993a0c_eyebrow">从表达出发</p><h2><span>每位创作者，</span><span>都有自己的世界。</span></h2><p class="k_5993a0c_body">一个角色的神情，一种难以替代的画风，一段还在生长的故事。我们希望每件作品都能留下创作者的视角，让你认出，也让你产生共鸣。</p><span class="k_5993a0c_rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></article><article class="k_5993a0c_chapter"><span class="k_5993a0c_chapterNumber">02</span><p class="k_5993a0c_eyebrow">让创作成为物件</p><h2><span>不只被看见，</span><span>也被日常陪伴。</span></h2><p class="k_5993a0c_body">将构图放进一块玻璃，重新考虑边界、留白与观看距离。Artist 系列探索作品从画面走向桌面的可能，让收藏进入每天使用的空间。</p><dl class="k_5993a0c_dimension"><dt>设计尺寸</dt><dd>490 × 420 mm</dd></dl><p class="k_5993a0c_specNote">厚度、表面工艺与底部结构仍在开发中。</p></article></div></section><section class="k_5993a0c_invitation"><span class="k_5993a0c_eyebrow">KIKORA / OPEN STUDIO</span><div><h2>下一幅作品，也许来自你的世界。</h2><p>面向独立画师与个人 IP 创作者。欢迎带着作品集，和我们聊聊属于你的表达。</p><a href="/pages/contact">与我们聊聊共创<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section><nav class="k_5993a0c_next" aria-label="继续探索"><span>继续探索</span><a href="/pages/glass-core"><small>回归纯粹</small>Core 基础系列<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/glass-covers"><small>把音乐的视觉，放上桌面</small>Cover 专辑封面系列<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav></main><footer class="k_45aaab5_footer"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerGrid"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerBrand"><a aria-label="KIKORA 首页" href="/"><span class="k_c22ae38_identity "><svg class="k_c22ae38_symbol" viewBox="8 4 112 112" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18 52 64 22 108 39 89 52 66 43 38 61 38 90 18 82Z"></path><path d="M66 76 90 60 110 68 66 97Z" opacity=".55"></pa